component.documentation:
Settings of the workflow graph. Properties prefixed with "org.nuxeo.web.ui" are exposed to Web UI as Nuxeo.UI.config (see config.jsp), here under Nuxeo.UI.config.labsWorkflowGraph.
To change a value, contribute the same property from Studio (Configuration > XML Extensions) or from another bundle, and add <require>nuxeo.labs.workflowgraph.properties</require> to the component so it is deployed after this one.
@since 2025.1
